# Pages scripts/parity-screenshots captures on the reference and the port.
# One per line: <path> [as=<user>] [ua=crawler] [mask=<selector>,...] [wait=<ms>]
#   as=      log in first (password "password", the seed's)
#   ua=      crawler: a Googlebot user agent. Rails then serves its unstyled
#            crawler layout; the port serves every agent the same page, so
#            only use it to track the crawler layout itself.
#   mask=    selectors (comma separated, no spaces) hidden with
#            visibility: hidden on both sides, for content that differs by
#            the clock
#   wait=    extra milliseconds after load (default 1500)

